[重构思路] 恢复 `#pragma once` 与 `constexpr`；若确实要移除 ceil_div，只删函数本体即可，不要连头文件保护一起删。代码示例：```cpp
#pragma once

#include <climits>
#include <iostream>

inline constexpr uint32_t next_pow_2(uint32_t const num) {
  if (num <= 1) return num;
  return 1 << (CHAR_BIT * sizeof(num) - __builtin_clz(num - 1));
}
```

